    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32514" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνήφω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ψω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					9.24
				</span></i>
			 :—<i>sleep off a drunken fit, become sober
			again,</i> l.c., Hippoloch. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				4.130b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
